*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
*%
*% Munbyn ITPP130 / ITPP130B 4x6" thermal label printer (203 dpi, 100 mm
*% wide) - Linux CUPS driver.
*%
*% This PPD was written for the itpp130-linux-driver project from the
*% printer's published specifications and the TSPL command interface it
*% implements.  Feature option keys and choices follow the vendor driver;
*% media keys use their actual PostScript dimensions so the PPD is
*% standards-compliant.  It is original work and does not contain the
*% vendor's translations or font tables (see NOTICE for provenance).
*%
*% Notes:
*%  - *cupsModelNumber: 20 selects the TSPL output mode in the
*%    rastertolabel-itpp130 filter (see REVERSE-ENGINEERING.md).
*%  - MediaMethod (Normal/Direct) is intentionally inert: the ITPP130 is
*%    a direct-thermal-only printer, so there is no mode toggle to send.
*%  - The option names AdjustHoriaontal (sic) and AutoDotted choice
*%    "Ture" (sic) are the vendor's original spellings; they are
*%    load-bearing because the filter looks them up verbatim.
*%  - DefaultAdjustVertical is 5 mm to compensate the printer's
*%    sensor-to-printhead origin offset (see README.md).
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "2.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "ITPP130.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Munbyn"
*ModelName: "Munbyn ITPP130"
*Product: "(Munbyn ITPP130)"
*NickName: "Munbyn ITPP130"
*ShortNickName: "Munbyn ITPP130"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 550"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsModelNumber: 20
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 gstoraster2tspl"
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertolabel-itpp130"
